<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0A1626' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '24px 64px', borderBottom: '1px solid #1E3A5F' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 500, color: '#E8F0FA' }}>第 12 章 · 遥控其余档（简述）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', marginTop: 6 }}>与飞控慢速档对应：菜单、对频、电压、失联检测</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '22px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    {[['100Hz','key_function() / Gesture_Check() — 菜单与摇杆上下选择操作'],
      ['50Hz','ANO_key() — 按键扫描'],
      ['20Hz','Show.oled_delay=1 触发刷屏 + NRF_Check_Ch() 自动对频'],
      ['1Hz','电池电压检测、帧率统计、NRF_SSI==0 → Connect_Succeed=0 失联判定']].map((d,i)=>(
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#0F1E33', padding: '14px 22px', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A90D9', fontWeight: 700, width: 120 }}>{d[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#9DB4CE', flex: 1 }}>{d[1]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
    <Box style={{ background: '#0F1E33', borderLeft: '4px solid #00D1FF', padding: '12px 20px', borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 2 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8F0FA', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        一句话带过：慢速任务，与飞控 20/50/1000ms 档<span style={{ color: '#00D1FF', fontWeight: 700 }}>一一对应</span>，讲完即可进入最关键的"桥接"。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, padding: '0 64px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>飞控+遥控 代码讲解（30min）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>18 / 22</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
